{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55397","headline":"十玄谈（幷序） 祖意 · 常察","name":"十玄谈（幷序） 祖意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祖意如空不是空，灵机争堕有无功。\n三贤固（《偈颂》作「尚」）未明斯旨，十圣那能达此宗。\n透网金鳞犹滞水，回途石马出沙（《偈颂》作「纱」）笼。\n殷勤爲说西来意，莫问西来及与东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}